MTD	mzTab-version	2.1.0-M
MTD	mzTab-ID	ST000054_AN000092
MTD	mzTab-profile	M+S
MTD	title	Metabolic Microenvironments in Normal Breast and Breast Cancer (MS analysis)
MTD	description	The purpose of this study was to understand the metabolomic changes in a breast microenvironment at various stages of cancer development and progression (i.e. breast, DCIS, and invasive cancer). The goal of this metabolomics pilot and study was to apply a broad spectrum GC-MS metabolomics method to determine changes in normal tissue of women with cancer correlate with progression and or subtype of the disease.
